.el .ds Aq '
.TH dalgon-help-plugin 1  "dalgon-help-plugin " 
.SH NAME
dalgon\-help\-plugin \- Manage configured plugin grants.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdalgon help plugin\fR [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage configured plugin grants.
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
dalgon\-help\-plugin\-grant(1)
Grant the configured capabilities declared by NAME.
.TP
dalgon\-help\-plugin\-revoke(1)
Revoke every persistent grant for NAME.
.TP
dalgon\-help\-plugin\-list(1)
List configured plugins and their persistent grants.
